From dbf69afe320ebdafc63c96d411b588f3b6167419 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dimitri Sivanich <sivanich@hpe.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 09:30:24 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 11188/15333] misc: sgi-xp: Remove SGI XP drivers

Working XP drivers require the GRU driver.  The GRU driver is being
removed, so remove XP as well.

Signed-off-by: Dimitri Sivanich <sivanich@hpe.com>
Acked-by: Robin Holt <robinmholt@gmail.com>
Acked-by: Steve Wahl <steve.wahl@hpe.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/amyxgPYeowzWt_8W@hpe.com
Signed-off-by: Greg Kroah-Hartman <gregkh@linuxfoundation.org>
